{"id":"da1164816c0805f0","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test.md","title":"三查询线性测试的傅里叶证据","display":"thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test — 三查询线性测试的傅里叶证据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test","aliases":["28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test"],"display":"thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test — 三查询线性测试的傅里叶证据","depends_on":["[[28-df-fourier-transform]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 22.22","source_printed_pages":"479","source_pdf_pages":"505","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test — 三查询线性测试的傅里叶证据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 22.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"479"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"505"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\epsilon\\le1/2\">\\(0&lt;\\epsilon\\le1/2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 为独立均匀符号向量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"xy\">\\(xy\\)</span> 为逐坐标乘积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S)\">\\(\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[f(xy)=f(x)f(y)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[f(xy)=f(x)f(y)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\left[\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_x[f(x)=\\chi_S(x)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\left[\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_x[f(x)=\\chi_S(x)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：接受概率 p 满足 2p−1=E[f(xy)f(x)f(y)]=Σ_S fhat(S)^3，字符正交消去所有混合项。Parseval 给 Σ fhat(S)^2=1，因此该三次和至多 max_S fhat(S)，得到正系数至少 2ε。后式由符号值相关性 E[fχ]=2Pr[f=χ]−1。这里用原书带正符号的线性字符，而不误改成绝对值。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 22.22；印刷页 479；PDF 页 505。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，$0<\\epsilon\\le1/2$；$x,y$ 为独立均匀符号向量，$xy$ 为逐坐标乘积。$\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S)$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0<\\epsilon\\le1/2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"xy","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[f(xy)=f(x)f(y)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\quad\\left[\\widehat f(S)\\ge2\\epsilon\\Longrightarrow\\Pr_x[f(x)=\\chi_S(x)]\\ge\\frac12+\\epsilon\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":["fcbf14393ebfa830"]}